WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.067 --> 00:00:20.179
"I have to find out what happened to Mayor Bloom!" thought Roxy.

2
00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:23.526
She looked at her friends.

3
00:00:23.527 --> 00:00:26.401
"Hey, guys," said Roxy.

4
00:00:26.402 --> 00:00:29.366
"I forgot my lunch money.

5
00:00:29.367 --> 00:00:32.807
I'll meet you at school."

6
00:00:32.808 --> 00:00:35.922
"I can lend you some money," said Terrell.

7
00:00:35.923 --> 00:00:42.675
But Roxy was already gone.

8
00:00:42.676 --> 00:00:45.765
A moment later Roxy arrived at City Hall.

9
00:00:45.766 --> 00:00:48.244
But the building had disappeared!

10
00:00:48.245 --> 00:00:51.842
"This is really weird," thought Roxy.

11
00:00:51.843 --> 00:00:54.346
"I'd better find Detective Smith!

12
00:00:54.347 --> 00:00:57.697
Maybe he knows what's going on in Metro City."

13
00:00:57.698 --> 00:01:01.618
Roxy flew to Police Headquarters.

14
00:01:01.619 --> 00:01:04.335
"Oh no!" Roxy cried.

15
00:01:04.336 --> 00:01:10.511
That building was gone too.

16
00:01:10.512 --> 00:01:13.603
"Rocket Girl!" a tiny voice called.

17
00:01:13.604 --> 00:01:17.851
"Huh?" Roxy looked around but didn't see anything.

18
00:01:17.852 --> 00:01:20.934
"That's strange," she thought.

19
00:01:20.935 --> 00:01:23.699
"I thought I heard someone say my name."

20
00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:27.051
The voice called out again, "Rocket Girl!

21
00:01:27.052 --> 00:01:29.219
I'm down here!"

22
00:01:29.220 --> 00:01:33.424
Roxy looked down. "Oh!"

23
00:01:33.425 --> 00:01:37.982
Detective Smith stood in the grass, next to a dandelion.

24
00:01:37.983 --> 00:01:40.280
He was about a centimeter tall.

25
00:01:40.281 --> 00:01:42.315
He didn't look happy.

26
00:01:42.316 --> 00:01:44.051
Roxy smiled.

27
00:01:44.052 --> 00:01:49.337
"It looks like you have a little problem, Detective Smith."

28
00:01:49.338 --> 00:01:51.756
Detective Smith frowned.

29
00:01:51.757 --> 00:01:55.340
"This isn't funny, Rocket Girl."

30
00:01:55.341 --> 00:01:57.659
"You're right," said Roxy.

31
00:01:57.660 --> 00:02:00.028
"Can you tell me what happened?"

32
00:02:00.029 --> 00:02:03.691
"We heard a strange sound," said the detective.

33
00:02:03.692 --> 00:02:08.418
"Police Headquarters began to shrink, and so did everyone inside.

34
00:02:08.419 --> 00:02:10.256
I jumped out a window.

35
00:02:10.257 --> 00:02:15.484
Then an enormous figure picked up the building and walked away!"

36
00:02:15.485 --> 00:02:17.748
Roxy scratched her head.

37
00:02:17.749 --> 00:02:21.278
"Metro City's new skyscraper shrank too.

38
00:02:21.279 --> 00:02:23.456
But it doesn't make sense.

39
00:02:23.457 --> 00:02:26.610
Why would someone shrink buildings?"

40
00:02:26.611 --> 00:02:30.073
"I don't know," said the detective.

41
00:02:30.074 --> 00:02:31.763
"But we need to find out.

42
00:02:31.764 --> 00:02:34.373
I can't stay like this for—"

43
00:02:34.374 --> 00:02:38.668
Suddenly there was a loud sound. Whirr!

44
00:02:38.669 --> 00:02:40.491
Roxy spun around.

45
00:02:40.492 --> 00:02:43.072
Another tall building was shrinking!

46
00:02:43.073 --> 00:02:45.390
"Uh-oh!" said Roxy.

47
00:02:45.391 --> 00:02:48.088
She looked down at Detective Smith.

48
00:02:48.089 --> 00:02:50.176
"You stay here, Detective.

49
00:02:50.177 --> 00:02:54.170
I'll find out what's going on!"

50
00:02:54.171 --> 00:02:58.016
Roxy flew over Metro City.

51
00:02:58.017 --> 00:03:00.120
She heard the sound again.

52
00:03:00.121 --> 00:03:08.232
Whirr! Whirr! Two more buildings shrank and disappeared!

53
00:03:08.233 --> 00:03:11.216
Roxy landed and looked around.

54
00:03:11.217 --> 00:03:13.636
She used her super hearing to listen.

55
00:03:13.637 --> 00:03:14.950
"Tee-hee!"

56
00:03:14.951 --> 00:03:18.535
"That sounds like a young girl giggling," thought Roxy.

57
00:03:18.536 --> 00:03:22.475
"The sound is coming from the other side of that parking garage."

58
00:03:22.476 --> 00:03:28.874
Roxy flew to the top of the parking garage and looked down. She gasped.

59
00:03:28.875 --> 00:03:34.121
A young girl in a space suit held a strange device.

60
00:03:34.122 --> 00:03:37.869
She pointed it at the bear statue.

61
00:03:37.870 --> 00:03:43.898
Whirr! The bear shrank!

62
00:03:43.899 --> 00:03:46.967
The girl put it in her pocket.

63
00:03:46.968 --> 00:03:49.770
"Whoa!" cried Roxy.

64
00:03:49.771 --> 00:03:59.732
"That young girl is shrinking things and taking them away!"
